   1053  fcf7							; --- D6 M1 (left-col block): M1X = 8*(m1_col+1)-1 -> CollisionEndX ($8E) ---
   1054  fcf7							; 0 = no M1 patch. Window: this VBL write -> PositionBallM1 reads it
   1055  fcf7							; later the same VBL (staged-file pattern like Temp/BallX). Overscan
   1056  fcf7							; routines (PHM/LWC/blast/laser) restage their own CollisionEndX values
   1057  fcf7							; AFTER the cave read, so the alias never crosses a frame boundary.
   1058  fcf7							; NOT zeroed with BandTab on strip kill — M1 is a whole-cave latch and
   1059  fcf7							; convert guarantees its cell is solid/unpatched (wall) where it must hide.
   1060  fcf7							; M1 strip DESTROYED (EnemyDeadMask b4, StripBlastCheck's M1 twin) →
