   1086  fd16							; 0 ⇔ symmetric (kernel ball block skips; verify_build enforces).
   1087  fd16							; CTRLPF: constant $35 (8-clk ball) — the P2 door 4clk eor ($B5) is
   1088  fd16							; GONE (user 2026-10-12: door must look like the plain async strip;
