   1229  ff59							; FetchPtr = record stream (all same-bank since A3). No field pre-read and
   1230  ff59							; no stack: fields are read at (FetchPtr),base+1..4 as needed. Returns to
   1231  ff59							; HOVnext / HOVlegHit (both pop the .HOVloop base) or HOVafterGate ($80,
   1232  ff59							; which needs Y = base — the $80 path never touches Y).
